TEXT -96 392 Left 2 !.param Ccpl=6p
TEXT -96 424 Left 2 !.param Cres=35.75p
TEXT -96 456 Left 2 !.param Lval=10n
TEXT 320 392 Left 2 !* UHF RX preselector @435 MHz (all-UHF architecture). Inductors: Coilcraft 0402HP-10NXGRW 10nH (Q~55@435), same part/values as the validated TX 437 BPF.
TEXT -80 792 Left 2 !.param Q=55
TEXT -80 816 Left 2 !.param RsL={2*3.14159265*435e6*Lval/Q}
TEXT -80 840 Left 2 !.param Cp=0.11p
TEXT -80 864 Left 2 !* --- UHF RX preselector, retuned from the VHF 146 filter. At 435 MHz, FM (88-108) is 4x away and trivially rejected -- the whole VHF FM/NF problem is GONE. Job now: low IL (NF) + reject the LO 2nd harmonic (870 MHz). Mirrors the TX 437 BPF; TX @437 is only 2 MHz away = in-band (half-duplex, so not rejected here). ---
TEXT -96 488 Left 2 !.ac dec 2000 10Meg 1500Meg
TEXT -96 520 Left 2 !.meas AC S21_peak MAX mag(2*V(out))
TEXT -96 552 Left 2 !.meas AC f_center WHEN mag(2*V(out))=S21_peak
TEXT -96 584 Left 2 !.meas AC IL_435 FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 435Meg
TEXT -96 616 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_fm FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 100Meg
TEXT -96 648 Left 2 !.meas AC rej_2lo FIND mag(2*V(out)) AT 870Meg
TEXT -72 888 Left 2 !.model 2SC3356 NPN(IS=6E-16 NF=0.98 ISE=32E-16 NE=1.93 BF=120 IKF=0.17 VAF=10 NR=0.991 ISC=0 NC=2 BR=12 IKR=0.17 VAR=3.9 RB=4.16 IRB=1.96E-04 RBM=3.6 RE=0.38 RC=2 XTB=0 EG=1.11 XTI=3 CJE=2.8E-12 VJE=1.3 MJE=0.5 TF=15E-12 XTF=6 VTF=10 ITF=0.2 PTF=0 CJC=1.1E-12 VJC=0.7 MJC=0.55 XCJC=0.3 TR=1E-09 CJS=0 VJS=0.75 MJS=0 FC=0.5)
